    {
     "tag": "P",
     "cls": "a1-txt",
     "t": "Most traditional non-solid LIDARs use slip ring to transfer power and data information, however, they only\nhave thounds of hours of life due to mechanical wearing out. Slamtec has integrated the wireless power\nand optical communication technology to self-design the OPTMAG technology, which breakouts the life limitation\nof traditional LIDAR system. It fixes the electrical connecttion failure caused by the physical wearing out so as to prolong the life-span.",
     "fs": 18,
     "fw": "400",
     "c": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
     "box": {
      "x": 10.9,
      "y": 15.6,
      "w": 78.1,
      "h": 11.7
     }
    }
